[{"text": "Hello everyone and welcome to EnglishPod. Happy New Year. My name is Marco. And I'm Erica.", "start": 0.8400000000000005, "end": 6.32}, {"text": "Happy New Year. Happy New Year, Marco. It's December 31st and we are on New Year's Eve.", "start": 6.82, "end": 12.48}, {"text": "That's right. And since it's New Year's Eve, we're talking about New Year's resolutions.", "start": 12.84, "end": 19.1}, {"text": "Right. In many places, it's very common to make a promise for the new year, something that you will change.", "start": 19.66, "end": 25.5}, {"text": "A promise to yourself. To yourself. To change something.", "start": 25.7, "end": 28.66}, {"text": "And that's what our dialogue is about today. So why don't we take a look at our vocabulary preview for this lesson.", "start": 28.66, "end": 35.56}, {"text": "Vocabulary Preview.", "start": 36.5, "end": 37.76}, {"text": "Okay, on vocabulary preview today, we only have one word.", "start": 38.14, "end": 41.62}, {"text": "Eating habits.", "start": 41.84, "end": 42.96}, {"text": "Eating habits.", "start": 43.26, "end": 44.02}, {"text": "Eating habits.", "start": 44.28, "end": 44.82}, {"text": "So what are eating habits?", "start": 45.24, "end": 46.7}, {"text": "The regular way you eat.", "start": 46.98, "end": 48.9}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 49.44, "end": 50.08}, {"text": "So if you eat healthy or if you eat lots of unhealthy food.", "start": 50.42, "end": 55.34}, {"text": "Or even maybe what time you eat, right? If you eat every day a certain time.", "start": 55.34, "end": 59.96}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 60.2, "end": 60.48}, {"text": "Eating habits.", "start": 60.78, "end": 61.38}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 61.64, "end": 61.86}, {"text": "So we're ready to listen to our dialogue today.", "start": 62.16, "end": 64.92}, {"text": "And it's going to be a little bit fast, but don't worry about it.", "start": 65.42, "end": 68.3}, {"text": "We'll come back and explain all of the key vocabulary after.", "start": 68.44, "end": 71.82}, {"text": "So did I tell you about my New Year's resolution?", "start": 79.76, "end": 83.9}, {"text": "I've decided to go on a diet.", "start": 84.22, "end": 86.38}, {"text": "And you're going to completely transform your eating habits, right?", "start": 86.74, "end": 91.26}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 91.72, "end": 92.44}, {"text": "I'm going to cut out all the junk I eat.", "start": 92.96, "end": 95.56}, {"text": "No more chips.", "start": 95.72, "end": 96.94}, {"text": "No more soda.", "start": 97.26, "end": 98.54}, {"text": "No more fried food.", "start": 98.9, "end": 100.58}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 100.58, "end": 101.74}, {"text": "I've heard this one before.", "start": 102.14, "end": 103.56}, {"text": "But this time, I'm going to stick to it.", "start": 103.92, "end": 106.64}, {"text": "I really mean it.", "start": 106.82, "end": 108.32}, {"text": "Trust me, Carol.", "start": 108.84, "end": 109.92}, {"text": "I'm going to be a new man in one year's time.", "start": 110.22, "end": 113.14}, {"text": "Well, I guess we'll just have to wait and see.", "start": 113.58, "end": 116.1}, {"text": "Thanks, honey.", "start": 123.94, "end": 124.94}, {"text": "That was a great meal.", "start": 125.28, "end": 126.9}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 127.24, "end": 128.26}, {"text": "Do we have any chips left?", "start": 130.28, "end": 132.44}, {"text": "So, Marco, do you think this guy will be successful in changing his eating habits?", "start": 139.22, "end": 145.02}, {"text": "Well, I guess he'll never change, but this gives us a great opportunity to look at some great vocabulary in this lesson in Language Takeaway.", "start": 145.46, "end": 152.44}, {"text": "Language Takeaway.", "start": 154.33999999999997, "end": 155.38}, {"text": "Our first word on Language Takeaway is junk.", "start": 155.38, "end": 159.58}, {"text": "Junk.", "start": 159.94, "end": 160.56}, {"text": "Junk.", "start": 160.78, "end": 161.32}, {"text": "Junk.", "start": 161.54, "end": 162.12}, {"text": "So, junk comes from junk food.", "start": 162.68, "end": 165.74}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 165.88, "end": 166.22}, {"text": "Unhealthy food.", "start": 166.88, "end": 167.82}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 168.0, "end": 168.12}, {"text": "Fries, chips.", "start": 168.76, "end": 169.92}, {"text": "Hamburgers.", "start": 170.68, "end": 171.4}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 171.86, "end": 172.12}, {"text": "All that junk.", "start": 172.36, "end": 172.94}, {"text": "All that junk.", "start": 173.16, "end": 173.86}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 174.62, "end": 175.34}, {"text": "Our second word for Language Takeaway, transform.", "start": 175.34, "end": 178.62}, {"text": "Transform.", "start": 179.34, "end": 180.06}, {"text": "Transform.", "start": 180.82, "end": 181.32}, {"text": "Meaning?", "start": 182.02, "end": 182.26}, {"text": "To change.", "start": 182.26, "end": 183.42}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 183.58, "end": 183.7}, {"text": "Change.", "start": 183.98, "end": 184.36}, {"text": "So, this guy is going to transform his eating habits.", "start": 184.74, "end": 187.9}, {"text": "He's going to change his eating habits.", "start": 188.1, "end": 189.76}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 189.84, "end": 190.02}, {"text": "Our third word is?", "start": 190.18, "end": 191.5}, {"text": "Stuffed.", "start": 191.96, "end": 192.48}, {"text": "Stuffed.", "start": 193.32, "end": 193.84}, {"text": "Stuffed.", "start": 194.24, "end": 194.76}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 194.84, "end": 195.64}, {"text": "So, we have some great examples on how we can use stuffed and you'll get the meaning from it.", "start": 195.98, "end": 202.34}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 203.2, "end": 204.08}, {"text": "Come on.", "start": 206.82000000000002, "end": 207.98}, {"text": "Have one more piece of cake.", "start": 208.22, "end": 209.9}, {"text": "Oh, I can't.", "start": 210.32, "end": 211.52}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 211.68, "end": 212.56}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 216.22, "end": 217.22}, {"text": "Oh, I ate way too much.", "start": 221.26000000000002, "end": 224.02}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 224.2, "end": 225.26}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 228.78, "end": 229.48}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 229.82, "end": 230.44}, {"text": "The feeling you get if you eat too much food.", "start": 230.44, "end": 233.4}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 233.56, "end": 233.78}, {"text": "I'm full.", "start": 233.94, "end": 234.5}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 234.8, "end": 235.04}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 235.8, "end": 236.32}, {"text": "So, these are some great words that you can use talking about food.", "start": 236.64, "end": 240.44}, {"text": "And eating habits.", "start": 240.58, "end": 241.42}, {"text": "And eating habits.", "start": 241.62, "end": 242.32}, {"text": "And now we can listen to our dialogue a second time.", "start": 242.54, "end": 245.82}, {"text": "And this time, like always, it's going to be slow.", "start": 245.82, "end": 248.72}, {"text": "So, did I tell you about my New Year's resolution?", "start": 256.53999999999996, "end": 260.8}, {"text": "I've decided to go on a diet.", "start": 261.24, "end": 263.88}, {"text": "And you're going to completely transform your eating habits, right?", "start": 264.1, "end": 268.68}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 269.38, "end": 270.04}, {"text": "I'm going to cut out all that junk I eat.", "start": 270.3, "end": 273.38}, {"text": "No more chips.", "start": 273.38, "end": 274.9}, {"text": "No more soda.", "start": 275.24, "end": 276.58}, {"text": "No more fried food.", "start": 276.96, "end": 279.02}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 279.48, "end": 280.02}, {"text": "I've heard this one before.", "start": 280.44, "end": 282.38}, {"text": "But this time, I'm going to stick to it.", "start": 282.76, "end": 285.74}, {"text": "I really mean it.", "start": 285.92, "end": 287.56}, {"text": "Trust me, Carol.", "start": 287.98, "end": 289.14}, {"text": "I'm going to be a new man in one year's time.", "start": 289.42, "end": 292.62}, {"text": "Well, I guess we'll just have to wait and see.", "start": 293.08, "end": 296.82}, {"text": "Thanks, honey.", "start": 298.62, "end": 299.66}, {"text": "That was a great meal.", "start": 299.96, "end": 301.54}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 301.82, "end": 302.94}, {"text": "Do we have any chips left?", "start": 304.28000000000003, "end": 306.36}, {"text": "There's a lot of great language in this dialogue, isn't there?", "start": 310.08000000000004, "end": 312.7}, {"text": "Yeah, a lot of great language that we can take a look at with our fluency builder.", "start": 312.92, "end": 317.04}, {"text": "Fluency builder.", "start": 318.1, "end": 319.02}, {"text": "The first phrase we have for you is...", "start": 319.24, "end": 321.92}, {"text": "Stick to it.", "start": 321.92, "end": 322.82}, {"text": "Stick to it.", "start": 322.96, "end": 324.08}, {"text": "Stick to it.", "start": 324.26, "end": 325.28}, {"text": "Yes, we've got some examples of how this phrase is used.", "start": 325.42, "end": 329.54}, {"text": "So, let's listen.", "start": 329.54, "end": 330.54}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 331.56, "end": 332.46}, {"text": "Quitting smoking is so hard.", "start": 336.91999999999996, "end": 339.38}, {"text": "Stick to it.", "start": 341.02, "end": 342.06}, {"text": "It's good for you.", "start": 342.26, "end": 343.26}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 347.46, "end": 348.42}, {"text": "I can't solve this math problem.", "start": 352.16, "end": 354.08}, {"text": "Stick to it.", "start": 354.5, "end": 355.36}, {"text": "I'm sure you'll get it.", "start": 355.52, "end": 356.8}, {"text": "So, stick to it, right?", "start": 360.20000000000005, "end": 361.66}, {"text": "Basically means keep doing it.", "start": 362.18000000000006, "end": 364.24}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 364.46, "end": 364.64}, {"text": "Even though English learning can be hard...", "start": 364.94, "end": 367.58}, {"text": "You should stick to it.", "start": 367.58, "end": 368.76}, {"text": "Stick to it.", "start": 368.9, "end": 369.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 369.58, "end": 369.78}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 369.78, "end": 370.14}, {"text": "Okay, let's look at our second phrase for fluency builder.", "start": 370.44, "end": 373.38}, {"text": "I mean it.", "start": 374.42, "end": 375.18}, {"text": "Mean it.", "start": 375.46, "end": 376.36}, {"text": "Mean it.", "start": 376.66, "end": 377.5}, {"text": "So, this is a great way of saying...", "start": 377.72, "end": 379.44}, {"text": "I'm serious.", "start": 379.44, "end": 380.38}, {"text": "I'm serious.", "start": 380.5, "end": 381.1}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 381.34, "end": 381.48}, {"text": "I mean it.", "start": 381.56, "end": 382.14}, {"text": "I'm not joking.", "start": 382.22, "end": 382.98}, {"text": "I'm not joking, right.", "start": 383.24, "end": 384.28}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 384.42, "end": 384.82}, {"text": "And our final phrase in fluency builder.", "start": 385.24, "end": 387.04}, {"text": "Cut out.", "start": 387.84, "end": 388.72}, {"text": "Cut out.", "start": 389.06, "end": 390.1}, {"text": "Cut out.", "start": 390.66, "end": 391.46}, {"text": "Again, we've got some examples of this phrase as native speakers use it.", "start": 391.46, "end": 396.28}, {"text": "Let's listen.", "start": 396.48, "end": 397.02}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 397.98, "end": 398.9}, {"text": "You have to cut out the salt from your diet.", "start": 401.52, "end": 403.84}, {"text": "No more chips.", "start": 404.04, "end": 404.94}, {"text": "No more french fries.", "start": 405.18, "end": 406.36}, {"text": "No more popcorn.", "start": 406.66, "end": 407.84}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 411.06, "end": 411.92}, {"text": "It's time for me to focus on my work.", "start": 415.0, "end": 417.62}, {"text": "I'm going to cut out everything else from my life.", "start": 417.8, "end": 420.64}, {"text": "Okay, so cut out means...", "start": 423.12, "end": 425.24}, {"text": "To remove.", "start": 425.24, "end": 426.12}, {"text": "Completely remove.", "start": 426.5, "end": 427.38}, {"text": "Take it away.", "start": 427.54, "end": 428.18}, {"text": "Take it away.", "start": 428.42, "end": 428.86}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 429.14, "end": 429.24}, {"text": "Okay, some great language, some great phrases in our dialogue today.", "start": 429.78, "end": 433.52}, {"text": "So, why don't we listen to it a third time and we'll come back in a little bit.", "start": 433.52, "end": 438.42}, {"text": "So, did I tell you about my New Year's resolution?", "start": 445.02, "end": 449.1}, {"text": "I've decided to go on a diet.", "start": 449.1, "end": 451.66}, {"text": "And you're going to completely transform your eating habits, right?", "start": 452.08, "end": 456.54}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 457.04, "end": 457.74}, {"text": "I'm going to cut out all the junk I eat.", "start": 458.22, "end": 460.84}, {"text": "No more chips.", "start": 461.0, "end": 462.22}, {"text": "No more soda.", "start": 462.6, "end": 463.8}, {"text": "No more fried food.", "start": 464.24, "end": 465.84}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 466.42, "end": 467.02}, {"text": "I've heard this one before.", "start": 467.24, "end": 468.84}, {"text": "But this time, I'm going to stick to it.", "start": 469.18, "end": 471.92}, {"text": "I really mean it.", "start": 472.14, "end": 473.6}, {"text": "Trust me, Carol.", "start": 473.6, "end": 475.2}, {"text": "I'm going to be a new man in one year's time.", "start": 475.5, "end": 478.42}, {"text": "Well, I guess we'll just have to wait and see.", "start": 478.86, "end": 481.38}, {"text": "Thanks, honey.", "start": 489.2, "end": 490.22}, {"text": "That was a great meal.", "start": 490.6, "end": 492.18}, {"text": "I'm stuffed.", "start": 492.62, "end": 493.52}, {"text": "Do we have any chips left?", "start": 495.5, "end": 497.7}, {"text": "Okay, so New Year's resolutions.", "start": 504.64, "end": 506.7}, {"text": "A really common and popular thing in North America.", "start": 506.7, "end": 509.52}, {"text": "It's tradition to make a promise to yourself on New Year's and stick to it throughout the whole year.", "start": 509.72, "end": 515.32}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 515.54, "end": 515.7}, {"text": "But the funny thing is that very few people actually stick to their New Year's resolution.", "start": 515.7, "end": 521.34}, {"text": "That's true.", "start": 521.56, "end": 522.12}, {"text": "The most common ones are, I'm going to quit smoking.", "start": 522.52, "end": 525.28}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 525.52, "end": 525.78}, {"text": "That never happens.", "start": 525.98, "end": 526.8}, {"text": "No.", "start": 526.94, "end": 527.16}, {"text": "I'm going to go on a diet.", "start": 527.36, "end": 529.34}, {"text": "Like this guy.", "start": 529.7, "end": 530.66}, {"text": "I'm going to quit drinking.", "start": 531.18, "end": 532.54}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 532.92, "end": 533.2}, {"text": "That almost never happens either.", "start": 533.5, "end": 535.0}, {"text": "On New Year's Eve, you start drinking.", "start": 535.14, "end": 536.42}, {"text": "I mean, it's a bad time.", "start": 536.42, "end": 537.26}, {"text": "Come on.", "start": 537.26, "end": 538.02}, {"text": "And another really common one is, I'm going to join a gym.", "start": 538.9000000000001, "end": 543.58}, {"text": "That's why gym membership sales are so high in January.", "start": 543.8, "end": 548.2}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 548.5, "end": 548.76}, {"text": "Everyone joins a gym in January, but...", "start": 548.94, "end": 551.02}, {"text": "Come February.", "start": 551.62, "end": 552.16}, {"text": "Yeah, and very few people in the gym.", "start": 552.4, "end": 554.34}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 554.54, "end": 554.76}, {"text": "So, Marco, do you have a New Year's resolution for this year?", "start": 554.92, "end": 557.36}, {"text": "Yes, I have a New Year's resolution, and I resolve to continue bringing everyone some great lessons.", "start": 557.54, "end": 564.7}, {"text": "Oh, that's so good.", "start": 565.14, "end": 567.18}, {"text": "And I think I can stick to that one.", "start": 567.18, "end": 568.82}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 568.9, "end": 569.1}, {"text": "Well, I do hope that you do stick to that one, Marco.", "start": 569.18, "end": 571.68}, {"text": "We will.", "start": 571.94, "end": 572.4}, {"text": "We will.", "start": 572.5, "end": 572.76}, {"text": "But today, we're out of time, so please go to our website and leave all your questions and comments.", "start": 572.88, "end": 577.98}, {"text": "At EnglishPod.com.", "start": 578.18, "end": 579.58}, {"text": "And we'll see you there.", "start": 579.9, "end": 581.34}, {"text": "But until then, it's...", "start": 581.42, "end": 582.44}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 582.44, "end": 582.7}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 582.9, "end": 583.08}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 583.36, "end": 583.68}, {"text": "", "start": 583.86, "end": 583.86}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 584.78, "end": 585.12}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 585.62, "end": 586.02}, {"text": "", "start": 586.12, "end": 586.12}, {"text": "", "start": 586.12, "end": 586.12}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 586.42, "end": 586.52}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 587.02, "end": 587.42}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 587.72, "end": 587.88}, {"text": "", "start": 588.64, "end": 588.64}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "end": 589.3}, {"text": "", "start": 589.3, "